-			/* Pixel: the bootloader may leave the unit not started (key 2, NOT READY). */
+			/*
+			 * Pixel: the bootloader leaves the UFS device powered down; every
+			 * logical unit answers NOT READY, "initializing command required"
+			 * (asc 4, ascq 2). Only the UFS Device well-known LU takes the
+			 * START STOP UNIT that sets the Active power condition (what
